# DINS Setup State File
# Location: /var/lib/dins/setup_state (production) or dins/state/setup_state (dev)
#
# Format: phaseN:step_id:status
# Status values: start, completed, warning, skipped, not_assigned
#
# This file is created by setup.sh to track progress through installation phases.
# The dinser CLI reads this file to determine where to resume setup after reboot.
#
# Phase Order (per PART 6.1.2):
#   Phase 1: Runtime Environment Setup
#   Phase 2: DINSER CLI Installation
#   Phase 3: System Preparation
#   Phase 4: Docker Swarm Setup
#   Phase 5: Setup Docker Service Deployment
#   Phase 6: Final Setup Routine
#
# Example entries:
#   phase1:install_packages:start
#   phase1:install_packages:completed
#   phase2:install_dinser:completed
#   phase3:configure_hostname:warning
#
